# FP user1 ilə yeni sandbox aç
* Set base Url to "https://api.anarabbas.com"
* "/auth/login" ünvanına "fp-login-user1.json" ile yeni sessiya açaraq login ol ve "token" tokenini yadda saxla

# FP user2 tokenini al ve user1 üçün yeni sandbox aç
* Set base Url to "https://api.anarabbas.com"
* "/auth/login" ünvanına "fp-login-user2.json" ile yeni sessiya açaraq login ol ve "token" tokenini yadda saxla
* "user2Token" deyişenine "${token}" deyerini ver
* "/auth/login" ünvanına "fp-login-user1.json" ile yeni sessiya açaraq login ol ve "token" tokenini yadda saxla

# FP alıcı yarat <fullName> <iban> <currency> <nickname> ve id-ni <variable> olaraq saxla
* "fpFullName" deyişenine <fullName> deyerini ver
* "fpIban" deyişenine <iban> deyerini ver
* "fpCurrency" deyişenine <currency> deyerini ver
* "fpNickname" deyişenine <nickname> deyerini ver
* Initalize request specification
* Add Endpoint "/beneficiaries"
* Add as a header "Authorization" = "token"
* Add as a header "Content-Type" = "application/json"
* FP alıcı body-sini qur
* Post request and display respons
* Status kodunun "201" olmalıdır
* Save value of "id" as <variable>

# FP kart buraxılır <amount> ve id-ni <variable> olaraq saxla
* "fpAmount" deyişenine <amount> deyerini ver
* Initalize request specification
* Add Endpoint "/cards"
* Add as a header "Authorization" = "token"
* Add as a header "Content-Type" = "application/json"
* Add body as text "{\"accountId\":\"acc_002\",\"initialAmount\":${fpAmount}}"
* Post request and display respons
* Status kodunun "201" olmalıdır
* Save value of "id" as <variable>

# FP kartın statusunu dəyiş <card> <reason>
* "fpCard" deyişenine <card> deyerini ver
* "fpReason" deyişenine <reason> deyerini ver
* Initalize request specification
* Add Endpoint "/cards/${fpCard}/block"
* Add as a header "Authorization" = "token"
* Add as a header "Content-Type" = "application/json"
* Add body as text "{\"reason\":\"${fpReason}\"}"
* Post request and display respons
* Status kodunun "200" olmalıdır

# FP ödəniş et <card> <billerId> <subscriberNo> <amount>
* "fpCard" deyişenine <card> deyerini ver
* "fpBiller" deyişenine <billerId> deyerini ver
* "fpSub" deyişenine <subscriberNo> deyerini ver
* "fpAmount" deyişenine <amount> deyerini ver
* Initalize request specification
* Add Endpoint "/bill-payments"
* Add as a header "Authorization" = "token"
* Add as a header "Content-Type" = "application/json"
* Add as a header "Idempotency-Key" = "${random.uuid}"
* Add body as text "{\"cardId\":\"${fpCard}\",\"billerId\":\"${fpBiller}\",\"subscriberNo\":\"${fpSub}\",\"amount\":${fpAmount}}"
* Post request and display respons
* Status kodunun "201" olmalıdır

